g power or pricing stability, good operating leverage, and last but not least, as I described, good asset quality.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/24/western-alliance-bancorp-wal-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WAL 2019 Q4","e":"wal","d":"2020-01-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dale Gibbons","x":"If we don't see any more rate increases, and I realize the futures market still has one in there, I think it might be unlikely that we're going to see one frankly in 2020 before the election, but if we don't see any, I think the opportunity for increased funding cost reduction is fairly limited.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/24/western-alliance-bancorp-wal-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WAL 2019 Q4","e":"wal","d":"2020-01-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Gary Tenner","x":"Was severance, was it tech writedowns, just any kind of background there?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/24/western-alliance-bancorp-wal-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WAL 2020 Q2","e":"wal","d":"2020-07-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dale Gibbons","x":"So prior to that rule change, banks could essentially do a 90-day deferral on anything without having it fall into a restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/17/western-alliance-bancorp-wal-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WAL 2020 Q2","e":"wal","d":"2020-07-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dale Gibbons","x":"So we will allow the longest you can go and not have it fall into a restructuring situation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/17/western-alliance-bancorp-wal-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"WAL 2020 Q3","e":"wal","d":"2020-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kenneth A. Vecchione","x":"We are encouraged by our expanding pipeline as clients have applied lessons learned from prior recessions to right-size cost structures and to begin to plan for future opportunities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/23/western-alliance-bancorp-wal-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WAL 2020 Q3","e":"wal","d":"2020-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kenneth A. Vecchione","x":"…with diligent expense management drove pre-provision net revenue to $181.3 million, up 13.5% year-over-year and consistent with our overall growth trend from the first quarter, as the second quarter benefited from one-time PPP recognition of BOLI restructuring in FAS 91 loan cost deferrals.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/23/western-alliance-bancorp-wal-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WAL 2020 Q4","e":"wal","d":"2021-01-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dale Gibbons","x":"…superior net interest income, grow pre-provision net revenue of $206.4 million, up 30.4% year-over-year and up substantially from the first and third quarters of 2020 as the second quarter benefited from one-time items of PPP loan fee recognition and bank-owned life insurance restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/22/western-alliance-bancorp-wal-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WAL 2020 Q4","e":"wal","d":"2021-01-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dale Gibbons","x":"We recognized a one-time benefit of fully restructuring during Q2 of $5.6 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/22/western-alliance-bancorp-wal-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WAL 2021 Q1","e":"wal","d":"2021-04-16","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kenneth A. Vecchione","x":"Generally, very few competitors, pricing power or stability, great asset quality.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/16/western-alliance-bancorp-wal-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WAL 2021 Q1","e":"wal","d":"2021-04-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dale Gibbons","x":"So I do expect that we're going to have a couple of quarters where we're going to right-size our loan-to-deposit ratio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/16/western-alliance-bancorp-wal-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WAL 2021 Q1","e":"wal","d":"2021-04-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dale Gibbons","x":"So what we're going to get from AmeriHome is also on top of that, is to be able to, again, kind of right-size our loan-to-deposit ratio in a way that's certainly accretive to net interest income.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/16/western-alliance-bancorp-wal-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WAL 2021 Q1","e":"wal","d":"2021-04-16","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Timur Braziler","x":"So as we start thinking about your new loan growth guidance, it shouldn't just be what you've been putting on existing plus the rest of the increased guide coming directly from resi.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/16/western-alliance-bancorp-wal-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WAL 2021 Q2","e":"wal","d":"2021-07-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kenneth A. Vecchione","x":"For the second quarter Western Alliance earned total net revenues of $506.5 million, net income before merger and restructuring charges of $236.5 million and adjusted EPS of $2.29, an increase of 20.5% from the prior quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/16/western-alliance-bancorporation-wal-q2-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"WAL 2021 Q2","e":"wal","d":"2021-07-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dale Gibbons","x":"It excludes pre-merger -- pre-tax merger and restructuring expenses of $15.7 million related to AmeriHome.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/16/western-alliance-bancorporation-wal-q2-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"WAL 2021 Q3","e":"wal","d":"2021-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dale M. Gibbons","x":"PPNR rose 57% on an annualized linked quarter basis to $317.1 million excluding acquisition and restructuring expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/22/western-alliance-bancorporation-wal-q3-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"WAL 2021 Q3","e":"wal","d":"2021-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dale M. Gibbons","x":"Finally, adjusted net income for the quarter was $238.8 million or $2.30 in adjusted EPS, which is inclusive of a credit loss provision of $12.3 million, but excludes pre-tax merger and restructuring charges of $2.4 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/22/western-alliance-bancorporation-wal-q3-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"WAL 2021 Q4","e":"wal","d":"2022-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dale Gibbons","x":"Noninterest expense, excluding merger and restructuring recoveries and loss on extinguishment of debt, increased to modest 1.6% or $4 million, resulting in an efficiency ratio of 41.3%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/01/29/western-alliance-bancorp-wal-q4-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WAL 2021 Q4","e":"wal","d":"2022-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dale Gibbons","x":"But then from there, what AmeriHome can do is, again, kind of process and rightsize whatever makes sense in terms of where they are on their profile given their opportunity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/01/29/western-alliance-bancorp-wal-q4-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WAL 2024 Q3","e":"wal","d":"2024-10-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kenneth Vecchione","x":"Continued interest rate cuts will enable Western Alliance to realize significant funding cost savings in both interest-bearing and ECR related deposits going forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/26/western-alliance-wal-q3-2024-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WAL 2024 Q3","e":"wal","d":"2024-10-18","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kenneth Vecchione","x":"So as we look going forward, we see a couple of areas that give us confidence to continue to restate and reiterate the guide of 